// A fast racer (2.6x the limit, 0.95 g corners) out-corners capped pursuers at dusk, breaks line
// of sight behind buildings and escapes after escape_time(level, Dusk). Violations are off so the
// chase stays below the helicopter's wanted level (with a helicopter overhead, escapes are rare by
// design).
// Re-aimed after main's rebuilt grid (#19-#27: a divided highway viaduct along x = 0 with diamond
// ramps). A racer roaming Core or Suburb was never out of sight for the 10.8 s escape time in
// 600 s, at any dusk sight range tried (200 m and 320 m), so pursuit heat took it to the
// helicopter's level. It now starts in, and keeps to, the Industrial district (warehouses
// block sight): 1-2 escapes in 3 runs on seeds 600-602.
(
    name: "police_escape_break_contact",
    seed: 600,
    time_of_day_h: 19.0,
    duration_s: 300.0,
    runs: 3,
    stop_after_first_pursuit: true,
    racers: [(district: Industrial, speed_factor: 2.6, cornering_g: 0.95, initial_heat: 15.0, violations: false, stay_in_district: true)],
    expect: [
        (metric: "escapes", min: 1.0, max: 3.0),
    ],
)
